<description>&lt;b&gt;XCZU15EG-FFRB1156 Xilinx SoC FPGA&lt;/b&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
    &lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Family: Zynq Ultrascale+ MPSoC&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Sub-Family: EG (Broad Device Range for Next-Generation Applications)&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Package: FFVB1156&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Application Processing Unit: Quad-core Arm® Cortex®-A53 MPCore™ up to 1.5GHz&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Real-Time Processing Unit: Dual-core Arm Cortex-R5F MPCore™ up to 600MHz&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Graphics Processing Unit: Arm Mali™-400 MP2 up to 667MHz&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Dynamic Memory Interface: DDR4, LPDDR4, DDR3, DDR3L, LPDDR3&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;High-Speed Peripherals: PCIe® Gen2, USB3.0, SATA 3.1, DisplayPort, Gigabit Ethernet&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;System Logic Cells: 747K&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Total RAM: 69Mb&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;DSP Slices: 3528&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;16.3 Gb/s Transceivers: 24&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;32.75 Gb/s Transceivers: 0&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;PCI Express: 0&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Maximum I/O Pins: 328&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/p&gt;</description>
