<devicesets>
<deviceset name="SD-LATCH" prefix="CN">
<description>&lt;b&gt; SD Holder&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Card Type:	microSD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pitch:	1.1 mm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand:	Molex&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Temperature:	-20ºC to 85ºC&lt;/li&gt;

Same components as 47219-2001 but with 4-bit SDIO interface</description>
<gates>
<gate name="G$1" symbol="SD-LATCH" x="0" y="0"/>
</gates>
