&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connector Style SMA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connector Type Jack, Female Socket&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impedance 50Ohm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mounting Type Panel Mount, Through Hole, Right Angle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequency - Max 12.4 GHz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ingress Protection IP67 - Dust Tight, Waterproof&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operating Temperature -65°C ~ 165°C&lt;/li&gt;</description>
