<deviceset name="WA-SMST_9774XXX943" prefix="MP">
<description>&lt;b&gt;WA-SMST Steel Spacer with through hole Ø2.25
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
Applications
&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;br&gt; Assembling of PCBs to housing and to other PCBs
&lt;br&gt; For distances from 1 to 8 mm
&lt;br&gt; Fast and precise process
&lt;br&gt; Strong holding forces and torques
&lt;br&gt; Highest process reliability
&lt;br&gt; Instant removable Polyimide Tape

&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;
Properties
&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;br&gt;Material Steel 
&lt;br&gt;Surface Tin 
&lt;br&gt;Ø f 2.25 mm 
&lt;br&gt;Solder Paste Thickness 150 µm 

&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;
General Information
&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;br&gt;Operating Temperature -55 up to +150 °C 

&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.we-online.com/catalog/media/o64624v209%20Family_SMD-Abstandsbolzen.jpg"&gt;
&lt;img src="https://www.we-online.com/catalog/media/o64624v209%20Family_SMD-Abstandsbolzen.jpg" width="320"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;
Details see: &lt;a href="https://www.we-online.com/catalog/en/SMST_SMD_STEEL_SPACER_2_25_INTERNAL_NON_STOP"&gt;https://www.we-online.com/catalog/en/SMST_SMD_STEEL_SPACER_2_25_INTERNAL_NON_STOP&lt;a&gt;&lt;p&gt;

Updated by Ella Wu , 2021-06-09&lt;br&gt;
2021 (C) Wurth Elektronik</description>
