<text x="33.02" y="246.38" size="3.81" layer="97">PMIC POWER SUPPLY</text>
<text x="33.02" y="124.46" size="3.81" layer="97">PMIC CONTROL</text>
<text x="299.72" y="63.5" size="1.778" layer="97">POWER ON SEQUENCE

1. GPIO1 (VCCINT_EN) -&gt; HIGH
2. GPIO2 (VCCINT_PG) -&gt; WAIT HIGH
3. BUCK1 (VCCAUX) -&gt; ENABLE
4. BUCK2 (VCC_3V3) -&gt; ENABLE
5. LDO2 (MGTAVCC) -&gt; ENABLE
6. LDO1 (MGTAVTT) -&gt; ENABLE
7. LDO4 (PSAVTT) -&gt; ENABLE
8. LDO3 (PSAVCC) -&gt; ENABLE
9. GPIO3 (DDR4_PWR_EN) -&gt; HIGH
10. GPIO4 (DDR4_PWR_PG) -&gt; WAIT HIGH
11. GPIO5 (+2V5_EN) -&gt; HIGH
12. GPIO6 (+2V5_PG) -&gt; WAIT HIGH
13. BUCK4 (+1V8) -&gt; ENABLE
14. BUCK5 (+1V) -&gt; ENABLE
15. BUCK3 (+3V3) -&gt; ENABLE
16. NRSTOUT -&gt; HIGH</text>
